Sphere of Ultimate Destruction	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Creation	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Medium	TARGETAREA:2-ft-radius sphere	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:Fortitude partial; See text	SPELLRES:Yes	CLASSES:Sorcerer,Wizard=9	DESC:Featureless black sphere moves 30-ft/round, disintegrates on ranged touch attack	SOURCELONG:Complete Arcane	SOURCESHORT:CAr	SOURCEPAGE:p.123	SOURCEDATE:2004-11
