Spiritwall	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Fear|Mind-Affecting	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:0 ft.	TARGETAREA:Swirling wall whose area is up to one 10-ft square/level, or a sphere or hemisphere with a radius of up to 1-ft/level	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	CLASSES:Sorcerer,Wizard=5	DESC:Wall of spirit-form causes panic, deals 1d10 damage if touched, can bestow negative levels if passed through	SOURCELONG:Complete Arcane	SOURCESHORT:CAr	SOURCEPAGE:p.124	SOURCEDATE:2004-11
